# Simnet image needs contracts/ (deploy scripts on the fork), unlike the engine image that the
# root .dockerignore is written for. BuildKit reads this file instead of the root one.
**/node_modules
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/.data
**/.cache
**/out
**/.next
**/settings.json
.git
contracts/lib
contracts/broadcast
docs
apps/web/*
!apps/web/package.json
